# Leaning giant porcini: the bolete of giant-porcini0.sdf, 6 m tall, its whole body leaning about 11 degrees to one side from its
# bulb, the cap leaning furthest. Standing in the open field between the castles, with no eyes and no hands.
format 1
collider convex

# Half the vertices its size would give it, as the upright one has
Detail detail=0.5
    # Turned about the bulb's foot, so the bulb stays on the ground
    Rotate rotation=(0, 0, -0.2)
        Union
            Material material=game_porcini_flesh
                SmoothUnion smoothness=0.35
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.65, 0)
                        Ellipsoid radii=(1.0, 0.6, 1.0)
                    # Stem: from below the bulb to 0.3 m above the cap's base (4.9), well under its top (6.3)
                    ArbitraryCappedCone a=(0, -1.8, 0) b=(0, 5.2, 0) radiusA=0.8 radiusB=0.6326
                    Translate translation=(0, 4.7, 0)
                        CappedCylinder radius=2.1 height=0.5
            Material material=game_porcini_cap
                Intersection
                    Translate translation=(0, 4.9, 0)
                        Ellipsoid radii=(2.3, 1.4, 2.3)
                    Translate translation=(0, 6.6, 0)
                        Box size=(5.8, 3.2, 5.8)
